		(descr "HRO TYPE-C-31-M-12 USB2 receptacle. Manufacturer contact and shell lands preserved. A5/A6/A7/B5/B6/B7 use single-object 0.15 mm F.Cu dogbones to staggered 0.50 mm safe landing anchors. F.Cu contact-field keepout forbids router tracks/vias while allowing pads. Verify purchased connector against HRO drawing.")
