		(property "Orientation" "CONSOLE SIDE faces outward from the board edge. Console mating view left-to-right is pad 9 through pad 1. Contact centers are 0,4,8,12,16,20,24,28,32 mm: continuous uniform 4.00 mm pitch and 32.00 mm pad-9-to-pad-1 span. The visible three console-housing groups are plastic divisions only and do not add contact-center gaps."
