			)
		)
		(property "Assembly Note" "MECHANICAL TBD / NOT PRODUCTION RELEASED. J1 is nine bare straight male conductive pins mounted directly to the PCB and projecting outward toward the console. Provisional mating section is 0.64 x 0.64 mm square, gold plated, and approximately 8.0 mm beyond the console-facing PCB/enclosure datum. Exact purchasable pin MPN, tail/retention geometry, production drill, plating specification and assembly method remain TBD pending connector-only coupon fit testing. The present 1.00 mm drills and 1.70 mm pads are provisional. A future keyed printed shell must align the pins and carry mating loads. No donor plug, cable, wires or female socket terminals."
